# Keep build contexts small and prevent host secrets/state leaking into images.
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/coverage.xml

**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
artifacts/

docs
**/*.md
# Package READMEs must survive the exclusion above: hatchling reads
# `readme = "README.md"` from services/api/pyproject.toml at build time, and a
# bare `!README.md` only re-includes the one at the context root.
!README.md
!**/README.md

**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
